# Optional, non-secret settings for Serbero. Copy to serbero.env.
#
# Secrets do not go here: under Docker they are Docker secrets, and under
# systemd they are credentials, both read through *_FILE variables (see
# compose.yml and serbero.service). SERBERO_PRIVATE_KEY and TYPESAFE_API_KEY
# still work as plain variables, but anyone who can inspect the container or
# process environment can read them.

# More verbose logs, for example serbero=debug.
# SERBERO_LOG=serbero=info
